    <h2>Aftercare Tips</h2>
    <p>
      Aftercare helps protect your results and reduce irritation. These tips are general guidelines and may vary
      based on your skin and the service you received.
    </p>

    <img class="page-img" src="images/aftercare.jpg" alt="Skincare routine items like cleanser and moisturizer">

    <h3>General Aftercare</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Avoid harsh exfoliation for 24–48 hours after a facial.</li>
      <li>Wear SPF daily to protect your skin barrier.</li>
      <li>Keep the area clean and avoid heavy sweating right after treatment.</li>
    </ul>

